# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Yuta Yoshimoto et al. (2026). Active Learning of a Neural Network Potential for Large-Scale Atomistic Simulations of Polymer Electrolyte Membranes.
#   The Journal of Physical Chemistry B. doi:10.1021/acs.jpcb.6c04744  arXiv:2503.20412v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2503.20412v2 (sha256 2594579e07015498...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 645 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/yoshimoto2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the final DeePMD (se_e2_a) model after 17 active-learning
# loops for Nafion at hydration levels 0, 1, 7 and 13 and for pure water,
# with its per-system training and validation RMSEs at iteration 17
# (Table S1). Earlier iterations (10, 13, 16) in the same table are not
# encoded. Structural, dynamical and proton-transport results are
# properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-yoshimoto2026 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Yoshimoto et al. (2026): active learning of a Deep Potential for large-scale simulations of Nafion polymer electrolyte membranes" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-yoshimoto2026 .

entity:article-yoshimoto2026 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcb.6c04744> ;
    schema:datePublished "2026"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Active Learning of a Neural Network Potential for Large-Scale Atomistic Simulations of Polymer Electrolyte Membranes" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6809-9276> ,
        <https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4856-0934> ,
        entity:person-Yamazaki-yoshimoto2026 ,
