###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - RMSEs of the models at iterations 10, 13 and 16 (Table S1) are not encoded; only the final production model is a run.
# - The total number of labelled structures is given per loop in Table 1, not as a total; no data-set size is encoded.
# - Densities, water clustering, proton transport, backbone dynamics and the omegaB97M-D3BJ cross-checks are property analyses.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/yoshimoto2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

